odulation of meiotic apparatus assembly and meiotic progression during oocyte maturation, possibly through regulation of kinetochore-microtubule interaction."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}